  "description": [
    "Despite the air being eerily quiet, utterly silent but for the guttering of torches, there is a vibration that can be felt in the soles of the feet.  It is not a gentle thrumming nor a rough quaking, but rather a rhythmic pulse that pounds like a heartbeat or the cadence of steps deep below the ground's surface.  An imposing black marble mausoleum with crimson-flamed torches flanking the doors stands looming off the side of the pathway."
